                        "editor": "<div class=\"mini-faq-item\"><div class=\"mini-faq-question\">Will people know I'm wearing Invisalign®?</div><div class=\"mini-faq-answer\">Most patients find that friends, coworkers, and clients rarely notice their aligners. The clear trays are designed to be discreet, making Invisalign® a popular choice for professionals and adults who prefer a less noticeable orthodontic treatment.</div></div><div class=\"mini-faq-item\"><div class=\"mini-faq-question\">Is Invisalign® worth it for adults?</div><div class=\"mini-faq-answer\">For many adults, Invisalign® offers the ideal balance of convenience, comfort, and aesthetics. It can address crowding, spacing, and mild bite concerns without the appearance of traditional braces.</div></div>"
                      },
                      "elements": [],
                      "widgetType": "text-editor"
                    }
